Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.88,0:00:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're…freakin' alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.23,0:00:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克爆炸时我们站得太近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standing too close to exploding Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.46,0:00:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,被炸进了炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}sends your ass straight to purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了整整一年 你怎么逃出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the whole year? Well, how'd you get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.44,0:00:10.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（走过的路）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.37,0:00:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.17,0:00:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是怎么出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell did you make it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.72,0:00:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 卡西迪奥 我叫娜奥米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Castiel. My name is Naomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.57,0:00:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We rescued you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.47,0:00:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 地狱之门 - 地狱之门怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hell gates. - What about hell gates?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.15,0:00:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,碑上讲了如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tablet told me all the stuff about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.29,0:00:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远关上地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}closing the gates of hell forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.45,0:00:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫艾米利亚·理查森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name's Amelia Richardson.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.63,0:00:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在德克萨斯州的科米特有个住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}She and I had a place together in Kermit, Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.64,0:00:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做什么呢 - 我准备走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.91,0:00:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我只是想做我该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I'm just trying to do the right thing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.09,0:00:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和唐该再试一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Don deserve a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩·温彻斯特 - 你是天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean Winchester? - You're an angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真名叫萨曼德里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Samandriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.98,0:00:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有碑文\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are more tablets?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.41,0:01:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是利维坦和恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than "Leviathan" and "Demon"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.33,0:01:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想那些无辜的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are innocent lives we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.75,0:01:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿凭本尼的一面之词冒险吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're willing to risk that on Benny's word alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,胳膊别乱动 邪恶的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lay down your arms, you unholy thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.08,0:01:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你的脑袋插在桩子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want your head on a stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.78,0:01:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,干完了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it done?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 有人伤亡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Any casualties?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.54,0:01:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马丁死了 - 是本尼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Martin. - Was it Benny?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.11,0:01:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自找的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had it coming, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.68,0:01:24.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.94,0:01:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜奥米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.85,0:01:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜奥米 克劳力抓住了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naomi, Crowley has me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.64,0:02:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用天使电台了 是吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Been on angel radio, have we? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别对我撒谎 阿尔菲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lie to me, Alfie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.62,0:02:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.50,0:02:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 我不会对你说谎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I wouldn't lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.85,0:02:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔菲 这都几个星期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Alfie, after all these weeks together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.73,0:02:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望你不是在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how … how I wish that were so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.93,0:02:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们只能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're going to have to…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.58,0:02:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,再一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn off that signal…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.44,0:02:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.28,0:02:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.21,0:02:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.98,0:02:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-o-o-o-o-o-o!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.41,0:02:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第8季第10集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:02:59.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（德克萨斯州 克米特）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.11,0:03:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.89,0:03:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,开了很久吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.53,0:03:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是你挂了我的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wouldn't have had to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.57,0:03:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不用急着赶回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you hadn't have hung up on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.95,0:03:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我已经听到我需要知道的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I heard all I needed to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.72,0:03:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你只是听到了你想听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you heard what you wanted to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都说了本尼没有杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you Benny wasn't killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼看他杀了那个在干坏事的吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I watched him end the fangbanger that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.58,0:03:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那马丁呢 他是怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about Martin? How did he end that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.67,0:03:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨死的 跟我说的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid … just like I said it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那疯子逼本尼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy son of a bitch didn't give Benny a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是正当防卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.55,0:03:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就用这种话来糊弄我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the story you're going with?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.27,0:03:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,说那个吸血鬼才是受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the vampire was the real victim here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:03:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你爱不爱听 这是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, like it or not, that's the truth, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.66,0:04:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前你不会不相信我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a time when that actually meant something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.37,0:04:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可不是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.96,0:04:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我只是为了本尼的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is just about Benny?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在扯什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.25,0:04:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you think I'm talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.18,0:04:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾米利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amelia?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.73,0:04:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你发那条短信是想让你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent you that text 'cause I needed you to … to …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.52,0:04:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You needed me to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,屁颠屁颠跑去德州\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tear ass to Texas?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.08,0:04:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我担心发生在杰西卡身上的惨剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be afraid that what happened to Jessica,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.74,0:04:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生在所有我们在乎的人身上的惨剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}what happened to… everybody that we care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.21,0:04:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她身上重演\N{\fnArial\fs30}might have happened to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.26,0:04:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去杀了本尼 你让我怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were gonna kill Benny. What was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.61,0:04:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为了救一个吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You save a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.22,0:04:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就骗我让我以为我爱的人有生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}by making me believe that the woman I love might be dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.86,0:04:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想听我说什么 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to hear, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,想听我认错吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I was wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我错了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. I was wrong. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.01,0:04:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你当时如果能听我说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you'd have just heard me out,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.27,0:04:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you'd have trusted me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有这一切都是能避免的\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of this could have been avoided.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.80,0:04:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是让我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't want me to trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.15,0:04:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是让我相信本尼 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted me to trust Benny, and I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.09,0:04:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.40,0:05:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我们现在该干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, then, what the hell do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.89,0:05:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}That depends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.55,0:05:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你的情况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It depends on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.21,0:05:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你和他还有没有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}On whether or not you're done with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.94,0:05:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, honestly, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.51,0:05:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴来跑一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad I made the drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.19,0:05:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经哭了两天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been crying for two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生忽视了一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctors missed something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.78,0:05:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是腹股沟疝 很难发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called an inguinal hernia … very hard to detect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.87,0:06:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 有情况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, we have a situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.41,0:06:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨曼德里奥被抓住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samandriel has been captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.01,0:06:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为萨曼德里奥已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Samandriel was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.15,0:06:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.11,0:06:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们知道了 克劳力抓住他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now we know … Crowley has him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.31,0:06:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪 - 我还没来得及定位\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - His distress call cut out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.85,0:06:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的呼救就被打断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I could pinpoint his exact location,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.65,0:06:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得找到他 并把他带回家来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you will find him and you will bring him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次克劳力一定会严防天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley will have warded against angels this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.93,0:06:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得找人帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll need help getting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.02,0:06:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要什么就带什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take whatever you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.74,0:06:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有一点你得记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will be certain, Castiel,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.08,0:06:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,营救萨曼德里奥是你自己的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was your idea to rescue Samandriel,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.47,0:06:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,与我和天堂无关 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}not mine, not heaven's. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.67,0:07:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你说过多少次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times I got to tell you…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,太吓人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's just creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.52,0:07:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使萨曼德里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angel Samandriel…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨 - 被抓住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam… …- He's been taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.38,0:07:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说阿尔菲吗 那个香肠店的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean Alfie, the wiener-on-a-stick kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.29,0:07:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天早上听到他呼救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I … I heard his distress call this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.39,0:07:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在天使电台上听到的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}On what, angel radio?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.59,0:07:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是给关上了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you shut that down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.06,0:07:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的苦行赎罪进行得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my penance, it's going well,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得可以重新打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I thought it was time to turn it back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 一直在帮助别人 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've, uh…been helping people, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,算你好样的 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good for you. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.33,0:07:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁抢走了天堂最可爱的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who snatched heaven's most adorable angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.35,0:07:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨曼德里奥被关在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samandriel is being held in the.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.71,0:07:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,内布拉斯加州 哈斯丁附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}general vicinity of Hastings, Nebraska.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.45,0:07:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,附近 只知道这些吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The general vicinity"? That's all you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.58,0:07:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 所以我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, which is why I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来这件事需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems this is gonna involve…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.56,0:07:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,和人们沟通\N{\fnArial\fs30}talking to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.43,0:07:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 我以为现在你是个猎人了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Cass, I thought you were a hunter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.87,0:08:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前也这么以为 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought so, too, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.37,0:08:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我似乎缺乏一些 - 能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- it seems I … I lack a certain … - Skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.19,0:08:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.47,0:08:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.69,0:08:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使受到折磨的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when you torture an angel,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会喊叫 而那种痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}it screams, and that kind of pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.24,0:08:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,产生奇怪事件的连锁反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}it creates a ripple effect of strange incidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.81,0:08:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.95,0:08:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.94,0:08:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我们自己也能找到阿尔菲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. We'll, uh, find Alfie ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只可爱的小金龟子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This charming little dung beetle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在埃及的沙漠上生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}makes his living upon the sands of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.11,0:08:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 无数微小的沙粒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, billions of tiny particles,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.59,0:08:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,无尽的撒哈拉之风\N{\fnArial\fs30}the remnants of ancient seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.27,0:08:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,将这片古海的遗址越推越高\N{\fnArial\fs30}are pushed ever higher by the relentless winds of the Sahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.52,0:08:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,金龟子就在这里生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where the dung beetle makes its living.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:08:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,古埃及人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ancient Egyptians…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.13,0:09:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚在酒吧里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, last night at the bar,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.32,0:09:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想确定那是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to make sure it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.68,0:09:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是往我家窗子里偷窥的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know… peeping in my window.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.95,0:09:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷窥\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Peeping."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.89,0:09:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么说的那么像\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make it sound so, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.60,0:09:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟踪狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stalker-ish?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 我跑出去是因为他要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I ran out because he was leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.78,0:09:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回来后 经常去旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}He travels a lot since he's been back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.93,0:09:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我懂的 你必须得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, n-no, I get it. You had someplace…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,去一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to be, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算一直让我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we gonna have a whole conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.03,0:09:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,替你说完话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with me finishing your sentences?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.90,0:09:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.05,0:09:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.33,0:09:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你遇到麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I thought you were in trouble…that you had…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.43,0:09:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不重要了 你没事就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter. You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.55,0:09:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前是没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.86,0:09:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,安定下来 我很满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, settled in…content.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.77,0:10:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么办呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我五秒钟 我立刻消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me five seconds, and I'll be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来给你添麻烦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't come here to make trouble for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来是因为 - 你在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I-I came because… - You cared?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.60,0:10:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.43,0:10:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又那么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just did it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.24,0:10:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,替你说完你要说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}finished your sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.48,0:10:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I care, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了那只是意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you it was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在就不会再发生意外了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now there shall be no more accidents,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.56,0:10:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不能用天使无线电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}no more angel radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.01,0:10:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下吧 求你了 都已经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop this, please. It's been…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.25,0:10:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好几周了 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…weeks, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我就快成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost there, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.05,0:10:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十分确信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm certain of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.51,0:10:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们恶魔附身人类时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we demons possess a human,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.38,0:10:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会侵入他的全身\N{\fnArial\fs30}we invade all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.95,0:11:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,肌肉 骨骼 还有大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their muscles, their…bones, their brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.75,0:11:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道天使是不是也是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help but wonder if it isn't the same for angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.32,0:11:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.69,0:11:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.74,0:11:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.13,0:11:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.21,0:11:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.95,0:11:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.71,0:11:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.43,0:11:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.44,0:12:08.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（内布拉斯加州 日内瓦）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.36,0:12:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛克利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Hinckley?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.01,0:12:31.62,Title,0,0,0,0,,我们是《日内瓦公报》的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Uh, we're from the, uh, Geneva Gazette.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.91,0:12:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问你几个关于你被「树袭」的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to ask you a few questions about your ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.50,0:12:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well…I'd laugh, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.37,0:12:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我的脸感觉像是被太阳啃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it didn't feel like the sun just ate my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个比喻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a metaphor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 在警方的报告中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Uh, now, in the police report,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.14,0:12:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,写到灌木对你说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it said that the, uh … the bush talked to you, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.99,0:12:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我知道听起来很疯狂 但的确是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know it sounds crazy, but, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.66,0:12:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what did it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.74,0:13:02.05,Title,0,0,0,0,,不清楚 听起来就像克林贡语（《星际迷航》中的外星种族）\N{\fnArial\fs30}No clue. Sounded like Klingon to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要确切的词语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna need exact words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.02,0:13:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.45,0:13:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这表情不是在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's his serious face, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.05,0:13:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得多少就说多少吧 辛克利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}As much as you can remember, Mr. Hinckley.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.38,0:13:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounded something like…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.69,0:13:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.14,0:13:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.91,0:13:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看 懂那是什么意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you think? Mean anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.45,0:13:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是天使语 意思是服从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. It's enochian. It means "Obey."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.69,0:13:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 服从 服从什么 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Obey"? Obey what? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.77,0:13:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那个天使肯定很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the amount of pain an angel must be in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不仅通过灌木显灵还点着了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}not just to manifest through shrubbery but to burn …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.94,0:13:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我们要赶快找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…we have to find him before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.37,0:13:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然都出了这样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, look, a sign like that …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.16,0:13:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔菲肯定就在附近 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfie can't be too far, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.83,0:13:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就从那灌木丛开始寻找答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we'll just start at the bush and work our way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.68,0:13:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底寻找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look for what exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.27,0:13:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力可能把他藏在任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley could have him anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:13:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if I know Crowley,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.53,0:14:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方一定聚集着一堆恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}the place will be swarming with demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.18,0:14:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们一走 直到遇见它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we'll just drive till we see ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.88,0:14:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定了 我不喜欢旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's official … I hate motels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.81,0:14:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.05,0:14:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you like me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉很棒 还是说这是不对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"That was great"? "That was…a mistake"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.27,0:14:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 或许都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Both, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.36,0:14:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.61,0:14:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白我在这儿有自己的生活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand I have a life here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.82,0:14:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个好男人爱着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good man that loves me…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.56,0:14:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个我不想去伤害的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man I don't want to hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.11,0:14:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我早晨一起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do you know you're the first thing I think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.87,0:14:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会想到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I wake up in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.13,0:14:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,临睡前还在牵挂着你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the last thing before I go to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.28,0:15:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 忘掉这种事情很难 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's tough to let something like that go. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其如果你总跑来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially if you keep showing up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.25,0:15:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想让我离开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying you want me to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.93,0:15:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 如果你要留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you that if you stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.66,0:15:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕是背弃我信仰的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}against everything I believe in,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.59,0:15:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都会和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.23,0:15:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你要离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you leave…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.84,0:15:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.28,0:15:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让你一边插足我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't have you with one foot in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.10,0:15:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边还在外面做…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one foot out there doing…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.66,0:15:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever it is you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.67,0:15:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那部分的生活我根本不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}That life of yours I have no idea about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.27,0:15:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.66,0:15:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.66,0:15:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这决定很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a big step.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.84,0:15:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我还是对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me or you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.90,0:15:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.61,0:15:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…need to think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.00,0:15:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也要仔细想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,言语无法表达你对我有多么重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Words will never cover what you mean to me …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.04,0:15:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这永远不会变 但是我们应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you'll always mean to me, but we should…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.27,0:15:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.43,0:16:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如两天后\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about two days from now…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,七点半左右见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Around 7:30?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我该下班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be off work then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.89,0:16:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一人来 我们就心领神会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of us will be here, and we'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两个都没有来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither of us will be here…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.19,0:16:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果不言自明\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.31,0:16:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我们俩都来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or both of us will be here…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就都明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.86,0:16:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, will you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.45,0:17:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,第九个废弃工厂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our ninth abandoned factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,壮哉我大美利坚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that America?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.87,0:17:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果还是白跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what do you say, this doesn't pan out,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们往回开一英里去正打折的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we head back to that beer-and-bacon happy hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家啤酒和培根店如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}about a mile back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.13,0:17:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.41,0:17:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些流浪汉 他们是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those derelicts, they're demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.47,0:17:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看清他们的真面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see their true faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.57,0:17:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力在外面安排了这么多眼线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's got that many hell monkeys outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.15,0:17:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面至少安排了双倍的人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's got to have at least double inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使的防护 我能感受到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And angel warding. I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.02,0:17:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你 我加恶魔刀就不够喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you, me, and a demon knife ain't gonna cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.73,0:17:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来联系萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'll get Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.89,0:17:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们不需要萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We don't need Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.10,0:17:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你刚说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you just said …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.97,0:17:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果萨姆想来 他早就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if Sam wanted in, he'd be here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.59,0:17:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有更好的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.30,0:18:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,读得慢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow read?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.21,0:18:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,龟速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slowest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖思在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Garth?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.20,0:18:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,去补给物资 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supply run? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.58,0:18:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太注意他的动向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of lost track of when he comes and goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要我帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys need help with something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.81,0:18:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.85,0:18:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你气色很差\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.32,0:18:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.02,0:18:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对 你没事吧 凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right. Are you okay, Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.76,0:18:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在忙这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just… in the middle of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.55,0:18:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And? Any luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.09,0:18:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指破译半个石碑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interpreting half a demon tablet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.80,0:18:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.04,0:18:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.77,0:18:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 打起精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, buck up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们迫切需要点恶魔炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, uh, we need some more of that demon TNT asap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都用光了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.95,0:18:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 所以再做一批吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so let's whip up another batch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.69,0:18:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.14,0:18:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,约旦河西岸的金缕梅 埃及牛的头盖骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}West Bank witch hazel, skull of Egyptian calf,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.04,0:18:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道是否\N{\fnArial\fs30}the tail of some random-ass newt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经灭绝了的蝾螈尾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}that may or may not be extinct …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.54,0:18:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了 我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, I get it …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,材料很难找到 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ingredients are hard to come by, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.76,0:19:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不止这三种材料呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just the first three ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.90,0:19:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我要什么 我去弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the list. I'll get what we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还需要什么 维果\N{\fnArial\fs30}What on earth could you possibly need now, Viggo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.98,0:19:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把人类所有的刑具都给了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've given you every torture instrument known to man …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.30,0:19:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就差尼尔·戴蒙德（60年代流行歌手）的专辑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short of a Neil Diamond album.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有所发现 先生 我需要个翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've found something, sir. I need a translator.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.36,0:19:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.29,0:19:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,展示给我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.53,0:19:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.64,0:19:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.35,0:19:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这是天使语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's enochian.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.11,0:19:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是天使语 笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it's enochian, you pigeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.08,0:19:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 他为什么说起天使语了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, why is he speaking enochian?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.52,0:19:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你钻到了什么 维果\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you drilled into here, Viggo, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.16,0:20:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.27,0:20:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.44,0:20:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bollocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 他说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的小天使说的 差不多就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What our feathered friend was uttering essentially was,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.59,0:20:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你们这些天国的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You, celestial being,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.07,0:20:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是被创造出来服侍主的天使「\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been created to be an angel of the lord."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.73,0:20:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进入了他的控制系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got into his operating system …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.98,0:20:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的出厂设置\N{\fnArial\fs30}His factory settings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,从谁那里呢 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}From who? God?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.41,0:20:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在乎这是从哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell cares where it comes from?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.47,0:20:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来瞧瞧这个飞猴是怎么工作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find out what makes this flying monkey tick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.61,0:20:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.02,0:21:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,从埃及弄个小牛头骨能要多久啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long's it take to get a calf skull from Egypt?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.15,0:21:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.31,0:21:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.46,0:21:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈很性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.95,0:21:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 你妈妈是个性感的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious, your mom is one sexy …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.54,0:21:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是让你藏起来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I thought I told you to go underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我藏得可深呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so far underground,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.19,0:21:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在用稻草呼气呢 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm breathing through a straw, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.33,0:21:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, look…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友马丁那档子事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened with your friend Martin back there,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.40,0:21:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,本不该是那个下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}it wasn't supposed to go down that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.71,0:21:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你孙女告诉我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Your granddaughter told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.33,0:22:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你真的很够朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you did this old dog a real solid,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.28,0:22:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为我挺身而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh…the way you stood up for me …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.06,0:22:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我俩互换位置 你也会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, shoe on the other foot, you would have done the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.25,0:22:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.22,0:22:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不想再求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to ask for much else,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.46,0:22:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你会不会碰巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't suppose there's any chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.80,0:22:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在卡茨基尔附近呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're anywhere near the Catskills?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.37,0:22:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在美国另一头办事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working a case on the other side of the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.87,0:22:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.09,0:22:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是有点难熬吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just hitting a little rough patch, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.47,0:22:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,独自一人 你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, doing this whole solo thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.23,0:22:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,本尼 慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny… one day at a time, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.74,0:22:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.07,0:22:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝杯咖啡对会我很有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…A cup of coffee sure would do me good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.67,0:22:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事一办完\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, as soon as I'm done with this case,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.10,0:22:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就来 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll, uh… I'll be there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.86,0:22:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.87,0:22:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, brother. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.63,0:22:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.42,0:22:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.01,0:22:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把你妈撵走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kicked your mom to the curb?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.36,0:23:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她太让人分心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was too distracting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.71,0:23:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法专心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.69,0:23:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使们说我必须去沙漠里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels said I had to go to the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.94,0:23:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,学习神之语 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}to learn the word of God, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.73,0:23:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是我的沙漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… this is my desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.74,0:23:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你妈还是你妈啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but your mom's your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.34,0:23:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拯救世界 就不能享乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't enjoy a world I need to save, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.38,0:23:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,等这一切都结束了再说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can enjoy it when this is all over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.40,0:23:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}For right now…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.57,0:23:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有比这更重要的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing more important than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.28,0:23:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着人类 永远都觉着新鲜 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watching humanity … it never gets old, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.07,0:23:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got what we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.19,0:23:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,也该回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.86,0:23:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.13,0:24:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.68,0:24:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一救到阿尔菲 我就退出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we save Alfie, I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.07,0:24:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们」一救到阿尔菲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, once "We" save Alfie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.11,0:24:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可别伤到自己了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hurt yourself, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.80,0:24:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡和我能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass and I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.82,0:24:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡可不这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not according to cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.39,0:24:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你说过我们不需要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you we didn't need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一切可能的帮助 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need everything, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.66,0:24:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我需要你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need both of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.80,0:24:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你们说的那样 把破事放一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you say, to stow your crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.94,0:24:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,能办到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.76,0:24:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有四个主护卫咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, there are four main points of warding …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.48,0:24:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,北 南 东 西\N{\fnArial\fs30}North, south, east, and west …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.64,0:24:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,四个天使语符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}And four enochian symbols,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.85,0:25:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样 你们得毁掉这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}like this, that you need to destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.34,0:25:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才能进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I can enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.09,0:25:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.89,0:25:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进去 解决那些混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go in, take care of the hell mooks,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.23,0:25:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去救出那个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you extract the angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.63,0:25:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.77,0:25:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了那么多同胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}After killing so many,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.29,0:25:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我至少得救下这一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to save at least this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.27,0:25:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来计划不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.78,0:25:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.29,0:25:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.54,0:25:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西不仅对天使有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doesn't just work on angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.79,0:25:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也能杀死恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It kills demons, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.45,0:25:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.44,0:26:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,套路有点老了 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not my most original work, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.67,0:27:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.99,0:27:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.92,0:27:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.72,0:27:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,和石碑有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was tablet talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.32,0:27:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护神之语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protecting the word of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.56,0:27:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎被根植到这些笨蛋的脑袋里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}seems to be hardwired into these dingbats.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.75,0:28:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.85,0:28:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.19,0:28:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.93,0:28:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,「恶魔石碑」 说点我不知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Demon tablet." Tell me one I don't know, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.05,0:29:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔菲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.43,0:29:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力先生 并不是说这不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}M-m-mr. Crowley, not that this isn't important,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.11,0:29:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但或许我们该准备离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but perhaps we should be making preparations to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.38,0:29:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们似乎受到了攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We … we seem to be under attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.55,0:29:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.77,0:30:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 小卡 出现吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, anytime now, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.08,0:30:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass! Hey! You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.95,0:30:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是因为这些魔符\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be the sigils.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.89,0:30:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的能量不够强\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not at full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.95,0:30:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 帮我把这东西涂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, help me muss this crud.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.66,0:30:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等 没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait! There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.55,0:30:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨曼德里奥坚持不了多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samandriel won't last much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.61,0:30:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.04,0:30:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 拿上这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.89,0:30:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.04,0:30:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,开啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.67,0:30:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 启用备用计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Plan "B."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.75,0:30:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有备用计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a plan "B"?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.71,0:30:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you were saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.00,0:30:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.82,0:31:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 不帮我一把吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass? Anytime now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.04,0:31:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.30,0:31:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.31,0:31:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点说 你个天堂的废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spit it out, you heavenly pile of filth!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.76,0:31:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,[天使语]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.11,0:31:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy mother of sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.45,0:31:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 他说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.11,0:31:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个天使之碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an angel tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.90,0:32:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.43,0:32:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 我知道一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! I know … I know things.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.17,0:32:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.15,0:33:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 你们有许多不知道的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, good. There's so much you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.13,0:33:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.88,0:33:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.94,0:33:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.93,0:33:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 你现在安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.47,0:33:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就带你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.50,0:33:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不能带我回去 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You can't take me back there, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.18,0:33:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.34,0:33:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.32,0:33:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉了克劳力一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told crowley… things …
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.14,0:33:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些他不应该知道的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things he shouldn't have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.97,0:33:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道了我们的密语 我们的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got to our coding, our secrets …
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.23,0:33:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道我们知道的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secrets I didn't even know we had!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.22,0:33:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}What secrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.69,0:33:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂 娜奥米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven, Naomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.38,0:33:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 谁是娜奥米\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. W-who's Naomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.01,0:33:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is …
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.41,0:33:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 认真听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. Listen to me closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.65,0:33:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去过 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been there. I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.57,0:33:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 他们在控制我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're controlling us, Castiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.26,0:33:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.45,0:33:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.42,0:34:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说「他们在控制我们」是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does he mean, "They're controlling us"?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.23,0:34:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.93,0:34:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在控制我们 我怎么会看见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is controlling us? Why did I see your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.48,0:34:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那时为什么那么害怕 你对我做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why was I so afraid? What did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.04,0:34:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a direct order! Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.62,0:34:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.04,0:34:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀死了一个叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.27,0:34:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨曼德里奥 是个好天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samandriel…was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.52,0:34:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本想弥补之前的罪过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was trying to atone for …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.20,0:34:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨曼德里奥叛变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samandriel was broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.09,0:34:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他泄露了我愿誓死去保护的东西的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He revealed the existence of what I would die to protect …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.27,0:34:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们任何人都会誓死保护的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}What any of us would die to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.58,0:34:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 天使之碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angel tablet, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.11,0:34:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.51,0:34:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了一个天使就为了保护一块碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just murdered one of our own to protect a tablet?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.60,0:35:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果恶魔之碑能把那群恶魔封在地狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the demon tablet can seal demons in hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.15,0:35:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得天使之碑对我们有什么作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you think the angel tablet could do to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.39,0:35:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 你是个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hero, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.97,0:35:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为天堂做了件大好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done heaven a great service.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.94,0:35:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟萨姆和迪恩就是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's what I tell Sam and Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.73,0:35:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass! What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.59,0:35:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉温彻斯特兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.66,0:35:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨曼德里奥变节了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Samandriel had been compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.65,0:35:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变节了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.79,0:35:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他袭击了你 你只得自卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came at you, and you acted in self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.19,0:35:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他袭击了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.38,0:35:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出于自卫杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed him in self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.79,0:35:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须把他的肉身送回天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say you must return his body to heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.34,0:35:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后带他来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then bring him to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.05,0:35:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.31,0:35:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的肉身肯定是在混战中受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My vessel must have been damaged in the melee.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.93,0:35:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.56,0:36:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨曼德里奥的遗体应该放在天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samandriel's remains belong in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.77,0:36:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得知道克劳力到底问出了多少东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to see just how far Crowley dug into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.29,0:36:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.04,0:36:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.19,0:36:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.48,0:36:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you both…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.62,0:36:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}For everything you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.85,0:36:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.37,0:36:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这样就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.63,0:37:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡现在看不到也听不到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass can't see or hear us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.38,0:37:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到底怎么回事 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, what the hell? - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.30,0:37:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说他从炼狱回来后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you something was off with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.52,0:37:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}since he got back from purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.90,0:37:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你觉得有人在对他动手脚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you think someone's messing with him or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.70,0:37:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁 天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who? Angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.28,0:37:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么天使要让他杀另一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would the angels have him kill another angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.41,0:37:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 我来处理吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, man? I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.48,0:37:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.59,0:37:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.08,0:37:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是有个女孩在等着你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you have a girl to get back to?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.03,0:37:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I guess I do. Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.30,0:37:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会站在她那边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when are you on the Amelia bandwagon?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.29,0:37:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.36,0:37:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是厌倦了这些争吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just tired of all the fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.38,0:37:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 也许我有点小嫉妒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, you know, maybe I'm a…little bit jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.66,0:37:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远都不能像你那样把工作彻底抛开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could never separate myself from the job like you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.80,0:37:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们俩至少该有一个过得幸福点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, maybe it's time for at least one of us to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.37,0:37:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你突然就接受这一切了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you being such a big hugger and all?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.22,0:38:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她确实能让我开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}She does make me happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.89,0:38:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我回去 说不定她正等着我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she could be waiting for me if I went back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.28,0:38:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是这样的话 我就太幸运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be a…very lucky man if she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.21,0:38:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.59,0:38:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切的危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}With everything staring down at us,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.53,0:38:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那么多事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all that's left to be done…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.71,0:38:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.51,0:38:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.40,0:38:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I do know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.65,0:38:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你的决定是什么 决定吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever you decide…decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.33,0:38:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,全情投入还是全身而退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both feet in or both feet out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.16,0:38:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你两者兼顾 会害死你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything in between is what gets you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.37,0:38:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 有人跟我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I keep hearing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.40,0:38:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出去走走 清醒一下头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna…take a walk. Clear my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.37,0:39:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.91,0:39:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,太谢谢你了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you mightily, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.95,0:39:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在很艰难 你快到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in a hard way here. How close are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.63,0:39:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我没法过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, man. I, um…I'm not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.83,0:39:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是现在 还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean now, or…?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.66,0:39:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.02,0:39:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会忘记你为我做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you've done for me I will never forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.93,0:39:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.50,0:39:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,到此为止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.39,0:39:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}End of the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.33,0:40:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}End of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.29,0:40:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 反正我也不喜欢这些手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I never liked these cellphones anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.01,0:40:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.03,0:40:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保重 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay good, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.46,0:40:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.97,0:40:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.47,0:40:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你带我出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.75,0:40:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,小事 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.74,0:40:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adios.
